{"id":"wb-3-62","name":"兴城城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"兴城城墙","text":"兴城城墙，位于中国辽宁省兴城市，即宁远卫城。兴城城墙始建于明代，现存最完整的明代卫城。兴城城墙原有内城与外城，现仅存内城。兴城城墙与陕西西安城墙、湖北荆州城墙、山西平遥城墙等并列为中国现存最好的四座古城墙。1988年，兴城城墙列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%B4%E5%9F%8E%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":90844336,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90844336","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1c30ecda3cdb7598fde2cfae.jpg","title":"Xingcheng_East_Gate.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xingcheng_East_Gate.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f9/Xingcheng_East_Gate.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Pechorin04","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"The east gate of Xingcheng's old town.","width":320,"height":132}}